"The capital answers Maud's surge report by sending a surveyor, who reaches Tarrant Ford on day eight."
"The surveyor is Magister Iola Brand, Tier 3, a dry, exacting woman with a space affinity."
"Iola carries a reading staff that can find the ring on Harrow Mile and the mana left in it."
"Iola will read the ring as a crossing of space, like the spikes by the border camp before it fell."
"Iola wants any stranger found near the ring brought before her tablet and questioned closely."
"Iola's tablet is a new model that shows affinities as well as tier and skills."
